    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hi, i've been taking atorvastatin and drinking a glass of grapefruit juice every morning like i read online can help, but lately i've been feeling some weird muscle soreness and aches in my legs. i'm worried the grapefruit isn't quite enough to kickstart the meds properly? should i be drinking more juice or maybe increasing my dose to make sure it actually starts working?",
